[CENTER][IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraHomes/assets/banner.png[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][B]Set, manage and share homes in one GUI.[/B][/SIZE]

UltraHomes gives players their homes in a tidy GUI: custom icons, permission-based limits and homes that can be shared with friends.
UltraHomes is part of the [B][COLOR=#8B5CF6]Ultra[/COLOR][COLOR=#22D3EE]Plugins[/COLOR][/B] series: every plugin shares the same colours, the same message layout and the same command structure.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-features.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*]Homes GUI with freely selectable icons
[*]Limits by permission (ultrahomes.limit.<amount>)
[*]Rename, relocate and delete with confirmation
[*]Make homes public – others visit them with /home player:name
[*]Warm-up, cooldown and world blacklist
[*]Import from EssentialsX
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-layout.png[/IMG]

No chat spam. Every confirmation, countdown and status appears in the [B]action bar[/B].
Only [B][COLOR=#F87171]errors[/COLOR][/B] are sent to the chat, so players never miss them.
All messages use MiniMessage and can be changed in the language files.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/UltraHomes/assets/preview.png[/IMG]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-languages.png[/IMG]

[B]English · Deutsch · Français · Nederlands · Italiano[/B]
Every player sees UltraHomes in the language of their Minecraft client – automatically.
Players with any other language get your default language, which you set in the config or with [FONT=Courier New]/ultrahomes language <code>[/FONT].
All texts live in [FONT=Courier New]lang/<code>.yml[/FONT] and can be edited freely.

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-commands.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/home [name|spieler:name][/COLOR][/FONT] – Teleport to a home [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrahomes.home)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/homes[/COLOR][/FONT] – Open the homes GUI [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrahomes.home)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/sethome [name][/COLOR][/FONT] – Set a home [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrahomes.set)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/delhome <name>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Delete a home [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrahomes.delete)[/COLOR]
[*][FONT=Courier New][COLOR=#22D3EE]/ultrahomes <help|reload|version|language|import>[/COLOR][/FONT] – Administration [COLOR=#94A3B8](ultrahomes.admin)[/COLOR]
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-permissions.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrahomes.limit.<n>[/FONT] – Maximum number of homes
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrahomes.others[/FONT] – Manage other players' homes
[*][FONT=Courier New]ultrahomes.*[/FONT] – Everything
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-installation.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST=1]
[*]Download UltraHomes and drop the jar into your [FONT=Courier New]plugins[/FONT] folder. Works on [B]Spigot, Paper and Purpur 1.20.4+[/B] (Java 17+), no dependencies needed.
[*]Restart your server.
[*]Adjust [FONT=Courier New]config.yml[/FONT] and the files in [FONT=Courier New]lang/[/FONT], then run [FONT=Courier New]/ultrahomes reload[/FONT].
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-series.png[/IMG][/CENTER]
[LIST]
[*][B]UltraSpawn[/B] – Spawn management done right.
[*][B]UltraTeleports[/B] – Requests, random teleport & back in one plugin.
[*][B]UltraPunish[/B] – Clean moderation with GUI, templates & history.
[*][B]UltraWarps[/B] – Server & player warps with categories.
[*][B]UltraChat[/B] – Formatting, channels & moderation for your chat.
[*][B]UltraEconomy[/B] – Fast, Vault-ready economy with multiple currencies.
[*][B]UltraKits[/B] – Kits with previews, cooldowns & in-game editor.
[*][B]UltraVanish[/B] – True invisibility for your staff team.
[*][B]UltraReports[/B] – Player reports with a staff GUI workflow.
[/LIST]
[CENTER]
[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/creativedm0031/UltraPlugins/main/shared/assets/header-support.png[/IMG]

Found a bug or have an idea? Please use the discussion tab or send a private message instead of leaving a bad review. We answer every request.[/CENTER]
